    "text": "allaboutkingfisher.com\nwebsite\nKingfisher County, Oklahoma\nKINGFISHER LAW ENFORCEMENT AND FIRE RADIOS GO ENCRYPTED\n7 hours ago\nStarting Wednesday, August 27, all Kingfisher County law enforcement agencies will begin encrypting their main radio frequency due to officer safety concerns. Kingfisher Fire Department will follow on Friday, August 29. Sheriff Aaron Pitts told All About Kingfisher the change was prompted by individuals using scanners to post officers’ real-time...",
